WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0124: lockstep export timing and a faster frame write (on top of 0001-0123).

- WOW_BG3_FRAME_TIMES=1: wowframe.times.csv beside the frame files, one line per exported frame: packet taken, ends of
  First/PreUpdate/Update/PostUpdate (stamp schedules), main frame end, prepare, publish, mapped, written, follow_bg3
  and apply_pose starts (CLOCK_MONOTONIC s). Off by default.
- The writer copies colour and depth into a kept MAP_SHARED mapping of the slot file, two halves of each on four
  threads (pwrite took the inode lock: four of them ran one after another). 2560x1440: 2.0 ms to 1.0 ms.

